# 시장 아주머니: says everything twice, 아이고 for everything, knows everyone's business. (format: js/core/villagers.js)

=== person ajumma
at morning sijang 66 52
at afternoon sijang 66 52
at evening sikdang 64 72
at evening madang 62 82
greet am_hi
chat 0 am_price if @sijang
chat 0 am_paint if @sijang
chat 0 am_tired if @sijang
ask 할아버지 am_ask_gramps
ask 물감 am_ask_paint if @sijang
bye am_bye
bye am_bye2
bye am_bye3

=== scene am_hi
ajumma[happy]: 아이고, {탐정님}! {어서 오세요}, {어서 오세요}!
(She waves you over as if you were a long-lost nephew.)

=== scene am_price
ajumma: {배추}! {배추} {싸요}, {싸요}!
(She holds up an enormous cabbage.)
* {얼마예요}? -> am_price_a
* {비싸요}! -> am_price_b

=== scene am_price_a
ajumma[happy]: {천 원}! {천 원}!
(A thousand won for a cabbage that size. She is very proud of it.)
! rel ajumma +1

=== scene am_price_b
ajumma[surprised]: {비싸요}?! 아이고... {싸요}! {싸요}!
(She looks wounded, then laughs.)

=== scene am_paint
ajumma: {빨간} {물감}{이|이/가} {없어요}. {없어요}!
(She shows you the empty shelf where the red paint used to be.)
* {누구}{예요|이에요}? -> am_paint_a
* {괜찮아요}. -> am_paint_b

=== scene am_paint_a
ajumma[happy]: 하하. {탐정님}! {탐정님}{이|이/가} {샀어요}!
(She points at you. You did buy the last pot.)
! rel ajumma +1

=== scene am_paint_b
ajumma: {네}, {네}. {내일} {와요}.
(New paint comes "tomorrow". She has been saying that for a while.)

=== scene am_tired
ajumma[sad]: 아이고... {바빠요}, {바빠요}.
(She sinks onto her little stool and fans herself with a price card.)
* {물} {주세요}! -> am_tired_a
* {같이} {있어요}. -> am_tired_b

=== scene am_tired_a
ajumma[surprised]: {물}? 하하. {저}{는|은/는} {물}{이|이/가} {없어요}!
(You meant to fetch her some. She laughs until she has to wipe her eyes.)

=== scene am_tired_b
ajumma[happy]: {고마워요}, {고마워요}.
(You mind the stall for two minutes while she rests. Nobody buys anything.)
! rel ajumma +2

=== scene am_ask_gramps
ajumma: {할아버지}? {매일} {강}{에} {있어요}. {매일}!
(She rolls her eyes, fondly.)
ajumma[happy]: {할머니}{하고} {친구}{예요|이에요}. {옛날}{에}...
(She raises her eyebrows twice. There is a story there, and she isn't going to tell it. Yet.)

=== scene am_ask_paint
ajumma: {물감}{은|은/는} {여기} {있어요}. {나무}{도} {있어요}!
(She sweeps a hand over the stall: blocks of wood, brushes, pots of every color except red. There's a gap on the shelf where the red used to be.)
! rel ajumma +1

=== scene am_bye
ajumma: {바빠요}, {바빠요}! {내일} {와요}!
(She has a hundred things to do.)

=== scene am_bye2
ajumma[happy]: {탐정님}! {오늘} {날씨}{가|이/가} {좋아요}!
(She pats your arm twice and moves on.)

=== scene am_bye3
ajumma: {네}~ {내일} {와요}!
(She's already talking to someone else.)
